  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/85VBf2K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"244\" /></span></span></strong></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/isensehostility\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_bg_tag_white.png\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"341\" height=\"129\" border=\"0\" /></span></span></strong></a></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">什麼是甲殼動物（Crustaceans）？</span></span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">甲殼動物是一個在遊戲中添加數種新生物的模組。這個模組的目的是讓海洋感覺更加多樣化且充滿生機，同時保持範圍的精簡。不同於添加各種各樣的生物，甚至是一大堆海洋生物，這個模組特別專注於甲殼動物這個群體。<br /></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">甲殼動物模組新增了什麼？</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">甲殼動物目前新增了兩種生物：<br /></span></span></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3366ff; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>螃蟹：</strong><br /></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3366ff; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Fg2xn6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3366ff; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>龍蝦：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3366ff; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XAKpDDx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 14px;\">有關這些生物的更多資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/ISenseHostility/Crustaceans/wiki/Creatures\">wiki</a>。<br /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 14px;\">甲殼動物也新增了一個新物品：</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3366ff;\">蟹爪：</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4uBx2Ae.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">有關該物品的更多資訊，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/ISenseHostility/Crustaceans/wiki/Items\">wiki</a>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/Hostility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f6084c7a-87f3-4946-abff-4917d097a513.png\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">需要安裝 GeckoLib</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>",
